      "content": "thanks for the tip about the sticky cards. i'll try that today. i checked the undersides of the leaves with a light but i still cant see anything. it's almost like they're just appearing out of nowhere overnight... really weird. do u think it could be something more like a fungus or something in the soil causing the leaves to just rot away in tiny spots?",
